<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (Enterprise Resource Planning \(ERP\) is used by organizations to integrate important business processes into a common system. SAP is one of the major ERP platforms used for managing business operations and information. SAP FICO is an important area of SAP that focuses mainly on Financial Accounting \(FI\) and Controlling \(CO\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (Financial Accounting helps an organization record and manage financial transactions and prepare information required for financial reporting. Controlling focuses on internal management activities such as cost monitoring, cost centre accounting, profit centre analysis and profitability-related reporting.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (During my six-week internship at YuvaIntern, I studied the concepts, structure, configuration, reporting, troubleshooting and future development of SAP FICO. The internship was conducted remotely from August 24, 2026 to October 05, 2026.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The internship was divided into six major learning areas. The first week focused on SAP FICO fundamentals. The second week covered configuration concepts. The third week focused on a real-world SAP implementation case study. The fourth week covered SAP FICO reporting, while the fifth week focused on common issues and troubleshooting. The final week explored the future of SAP FICO and modern SAP Finance technologies.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
