/E (SAP FICO consists of two closely connected areas: Financial Accounting \(FI\) and Controlling \(CO\). Financial Accounting deals with external financial reporting and records financial transactions. Major areas include General Ledger, Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable and Asset Accounting.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
